      "retrieval_hit_context_full": "Stafl and Caelynn cut loose a dinghy and let the river take them after Bonogo, with only a net with light cast on it and hope.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/mirathorn/\nEphanna and the mage hand coaxed Bubbles to the lasso and were able to get her to the dock across the ice path and rushing river.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/mirathorn/\nBonogo was rescued, the wet adventurers headed to the Pub to find a damp, but generally relieved, safe, and drying town.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/mirathorn/\nDropping everything and rushing outside, you found Pippa, soaked and panicked.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/baergrom/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/caelynn/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nWhere Ephanna hopped on Bubbles back and followed after the runaway boats.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/mirathorn/\nsession locations location places place setting map stonebridge Stone Bridge town; flood and rescue set-piece. longmont campaign longmont campaign campaign 1 rivers_edge_pub Grishna's tavern during the storm. rivers edge pub rivers edge pub wizards_tower_brewing_company Bardic retelling beat ties back to the brewery crawl. wizards tower brewing company wizards tower brewing company mirathorn Festival-city hook named in closing beats; table-facing route placeholder.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/wizards_tower_brewing_company/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/mirathorn/\nBonogo dives in the water, Baergrom loses the rope.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/baergrom/\nBonogo flows downstream and has a wonderful zen underwater adventure.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nPippa a bright and talkative Gnome obsessed with crafting and understanding beer, hitched up Bubbles the Float Goat to her wagon full of kegs and led the crew to a dock and barge on the river.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/rivers_edge_pub/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/grishna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/pippa/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nCollapsing to sleep, they woke up the next day with the most important question of all.\nWhat now?\nSure they were heroes of Stone Bridge, and definitely the saviors of Bubbles the Float Goat, but so what?\nWhat about that city Pippa was talking about, where they were having a festival?\nIn the face of a rapidly deteriorating situation, Karsemine cast Zephyr strike and ran down the bank, shooting arrows at wear Bonogo probably was.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/karsemine/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/caelynn/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nThoroughly fermented) Bonogo dives into the river with full trust in Baergrom to hold the rope, which is immediately torn out of Baergrom's hand.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/karsemine/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/caelynn/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nUnprepared for the speed with which the river carries Bonogo away, the rope and Bonogo are gone.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/karsemine/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/caelynn/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nThe only remenant, the end of the rope whipping across the top of the river, vanishing out of sight.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/karsemine/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/stafl/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/caelynn/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/\nGripping onto the front of the pub holding on in rushing water up to her waste.\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/NPCs/bubbles_the_float_goat/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/ephanna/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/bonogo/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/PCs/baergrom/\nLongmont Campaign/Campaign 1/Locations/stonebridge/",
