    "llm_answer_preview": "On the rock in the river, Bubbles is described as \u201cwildly bleating,\u201d clearly distressed and not calmly cooperating. Ephanna first tries to reach her by using a mage hand to lasso her from a distance. However, this initial attempt doesn\u2019t work\u2014only the second use of the mage hand successfully gets the lasso around Bubbles.\n\nDuring this time, Bubbles continues reacting nervously, bleating and needing to be coaxed rather than immediately complying. With Ephanna and the mage hand working together, they eventually manage to guide her into the lasso and lead her safely back across the ice path and rushing river.",
    "retrieved_context_preview": "Ephanna uses mage hand to lasso Bubbles on the rock.\nRapidly searching around Bubbles is found wildly bleating on a rock in the river.\nEphanna and the mage hand coaxed Bubbles to the lasso and were able to get her to the dock across the ice path and rushing river.\nEphanna's mage hand succeeds the second time and lassos Bubbles, lead her to Ephanna.\nPippa a bright and talkative Gnome obsessed with crafting and understanding beer, hitched up Bubbles the Float Goat to her wagon full of kegs and led the crew to a dock and barge on the river.\nWhere Ephanna hopped on Bubbles back and followed after the runaway boats.\nReady for some rest, ready to not be covered in the sweat and ichor of the day, Caelynn, Karsemine, Stafl, Baergrom, and Ephanna accepted the offer of a ride to StoneBridge with Pippa.\nAlong the way down river, they encountered an elderly fisherman, whose net was stuck.",
